  "description": "Godot 4 glue for Noodloft components: an ILogger over GD.Print/PushWarning/PushError, and\n            an ISaveStore over user:// via Godot's own FileAccess, so saves work on Android and web\n            where there is no real filesystem path.\n\n            The nodes and resources are NOT in this package. Godot keys C# script types to a res://\n            path, which a type inside a DLL does not have, so they ship as addon source instead.",
